     A                                      COLHDG('PGM')
     A            MEDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE')
     A            METM      R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('TIME')
     A            MEWKS     R               REFFLD(A20)
     A                                      COLHDG('NUMBER OF WEEKS')
